      "comment": "Maghan's Master: Maghan's Master",
      "content": "Last Holy Sovereign of the valley tribe that became Mictlan. A blinded, lamed seer chosen as a child, she was Dinga's mistress. She told him to follow Xbalanque, record heroes' stories on woven scrolls and kill her when they met again; he did so as Maghan, and she became the tribe's Wayob. Her statuette is Starcaller's Watch.",
