      "comment": "Maghan's Master: The Holy Sovereign's pact",
      "content": "The Weaver of Secrets offered the valley a labyrinth of mirrors and a fortress of mist if the humans appointed a Holy Sovereign to lead the dragons into a shared dream. The Sovereign was chosen by a star-bright soul approved by the Lord of the Night and was blinded and crippled, so the office was in effect a sacrifice. Her last wish was that the old pact be broken and replaced by a new one that would bring peace to humans and dragons.",
